َّا رَبُّ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضِ بَصَائِرَ وَإِنِّي لَأَظُنُّكَ يَا فِرْعَوْنُ مَثْبُورًا﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">[Moses] said, &quot;You have already known that none has sent down these [signs] except the Lord of the heavens and the earth as evidence, and indeed I think, O Pharaoh, that you are destroyed.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فدل على أن فرعون كان عالما بأن الله أنزل الآيات<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 7/189</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s17a102\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/17-99.html\">Previous verse (17:99)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/17-107.html\">Next verse (17:107)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/17-107.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Israa 17:107 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Say, &quot;Believe in it or do not believe.&quot; Indeed, those who were given knowledge before it - when it is recited to them, they fall upon their faces in prostr\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/17-107.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/17-107.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\"